==Trivia==
*All Ubers in this set at the time (Zeus, Anubis, Aphrodite, Amaterasu, Ganesha, Poseidon, Chronos, and Hades) received True Forms and talents in the same update, [[Version 9.10 Update|9.10]], making them the only set where every Uber is complete.
**Prior to that, they were the only regular set without any Uber with a True Form.
*All True Forms have a golden fairy and a fruit somewhere by the unit, but no real changes to the design otherwise
**The fruit is called the "Fruit of Creation" in their True Forms' descriptions.
**The golden fairies mimic their Uber's attack animation.
*All True Forms require an Epic Catfruit Seed and only one other type.

